  "task": "C11 replaces C8. Same property -- SubagentStop consumes on the RECEIPT and not on the ACTIVE_RUN pointer, with the bracket retained as raw bytes -- but with honest provenance. C8 declared head_commit 4022385, where the stop hook hashes to 0533da88, the very value C8 said had gone stale; the bytes it attested first exist at 9df6cd4, C8's own sealing commit. A canary runs BEFORE its sealing commit, so git rev-parse HEAD at write time is structurally the wrong answer. C11 declares PENDING_COMMIT and is pinned by a follow-up, the convention SSOT_FACTS.json already uses.",
